msgid "Containers & matrices"
msgstr "コンテナと行列"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:3 e43d7cee497f4a4bbe5b1331048cc0e7
msgid ""
"Work with the matrix and field containers that extend GWpy's series types."
msgstr "GWpy の系列型を拡張する行列・場コンテナを扱います。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:9 0009cf7eea444b99a0795878a88d4f26
msgid "FrequencySeriesMatrix: Matrix Basics"
msgstr "FrequencySeriesMatrix: 行列処理の基本"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:13 011e9c09697b4e74915185989a160c99
msgid ""
"A 3D container (row x col x freq) for batches of `FrequencySeries` with "
"frequency-domain-aware indexing."
msgstr ""
"`FrequencySeries` をまとめて扱う3次元コンテナ（行 x 列 x 周波数）。周波数領域を意識したインデクシングに対応します。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:16 cd381972b25d4988904c47d1eff4e7a9
msgid "SpectrogramMatrix: Matrix Basics"
msgstr "SpectrogramMatrix: 行列処理の基本"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:20 424d5e18b6694bca9d812194f1bead52
msgid ""
"Handle multiple `Spectrogram` objects as a single 3D (batch, time, "
"frequency) container."
msgstr "複数の `Spectrogram` オブジェクトを1つの3次元（バッチ、時刻、周波数）コンテナとして扱います。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:23 f268c7f5f0904cd2af53543a09ca28a2
msgid "Field API: ScalarField Basics"
msgstr "Field API: ScalarField の基本"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:27 6d272fdbcca54006a03a4e9249e1ea73
msgid ""
"Basic usage of `ScalarField` for 4D (time + 3D space) data, including "
"indexing and metadata handling."
msgstr "時間＋3次元空間の4次元データを扱う `ScalarField` の基本的な使い方（インデクシングとメタデータの扱いを含む）。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:30 c00b7af3de364846b880bb88880d0815
msgid "Field API: Advanced Analysis Workflow"
msgstr "Field API: 高度解析ワークフロー"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:34 c9ba82cc72fa48cd8b67dab6ad61aae8
msgid ""
"A full analysis workflow built on `ScalarField`, going beyond the basics "
"into applied field processing."
msgstr "`ScalarField` を使った一連の解析ワークフロー。基本を超えて実践的な場のデータ処理に踏み込みます。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:37 000ad5f3606145818e30084138c21b68
msgid "Scalar Field Slicing Guide (Why 4D is Preserved)"
msgstr "スカラー場のスライス操作ガイド（なぜ 4 次元が保たれるのか）"

#: ../../how-to/containers/index.md:41 e56da43363cf4844a4f9cfba1b371eb1
msgid ""
"Why `ScalarField` indexing always keeps 4 dimensions instead of collapsing "
"like NumPy, and when `squeeze()` is safe."
msgstr ""
"`ScalarField` のインデクシングが NumPy のように次元を落とさず常に 4 次元を保つ理由と、`squeeze()` が安全な場面。"
